    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d675">

                <pb facs="1013" n="985" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v03/pg985"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">
                    UNP files, lot 59 D 237, “Membership”</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by an Adviser of the United States Delegation to the General
                        Assembly</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Key</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1953-10-08">October 8,
                        1953</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <item>Subject:</item>
                    <item>
                        UN Membership</item>
                </list>
                <p>Ambassador Sarasin (Thailand)
                    informed me that his delegation would vote against the Soviet “package” proposal
                    and would vote for the Peruvian resolution.</p>
                <p>
                    Sarasin, who is the Thai
                    representation on the <hi rendition="#italic">Ad Hoc</hi> Committee, said that
                    he was not planning to speak on this question.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
